# axiom explain, every code and every spelling.
# AX1001-AX5001 were materialized from the Rust compiler at commit 1041f11 on
# 2026-08-08; AX3018-AX3022 (macro expansion) postdate its deletion and originate
# in self_host/explain.ax. The list section's COLOUR is RECONSTRUCTED, not captured.
